# Allowlist for `vercel deploy` from the repo root (Root Directory = app): only the pnpm workspace files and the app.
/*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!app
!keeper
# app/src/games/block-puzzle/engine.test.ts imports it, and next build typechecks tests.
!programs
programs/*
!programs/block_puzzle
programs/block_puzzle/*
!programs/block_puzzle/tests
programs/block_puzzle/tests/*
!programs/block_puzzle/tests/vectors.json
# QA screenshots and docs (~220 MB); the site doesn't read them.
app/docs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
!app/.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
keeper/src
